* In the 13th century, the main line of the Fujiwara family split into five families or houses: the [[Kujō family|Kujō]], [[Nijō family|Nijō]] and [[Ichijō family|Ichijō]] (descendants of Kanezane); and also the [[Konoe family|Konoe]] and [[Takatsukasa family|Takatsukasa]] (descendants of Motozane).
