* In the 13th century, the main line of the Fujiwara family split into "[[:en:Five regent houses|Five regent houses]]": the [[:en:Kujō family|Kujō]], [[:en:Nijō family|Nijō]] and [[:en:Ichijō family|Ichijō]] (descendants of Kanezane); and also the [[:en:Konoe family|Konoe]] and [[:en:Takatsukasa family|Takatsukasa]] (descendants of Motozane). To view the complete family tree, visit [[:en:Fujiwara family tree|Fujiwara family tree]].
